    <criterion testable="true">Given a docx opened via upload, browse, and open-in-Compose, when the editor mounts, then all three render via the server projection with no console errors.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The editor surface renders theme-correct in dark and light mode after the deletion (ADR-021).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no SprkChat/Notepad `mammoth` call site was modified or removed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Compose client builds green; `/conflict-check` clean.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">TASK-INDEX.md shows task 013 as ✅ and any deviation is recorded in projects/spaarkeai-compose-fidelity-r4.5/notes/.</criterion>
